{"4832390": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sumeru Divine Endeavor", "steam_appid": 4832390, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4832390/extras/c6f958f3bc81bf11f0b693e3c7baf07e.avif?t=1783079062\" width=1549 height=664 /></span><strong>Sumeru Divine Endeavor</strong> is an idle cultivation game that sits right on your desktop. Whether you're working, studying, or gaming, your Sect is always there, thriving in the background. Manage your path to immortality whenever, wherever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit disciples, undergo tribulations, farm, fish, duel, nurture spirit beasts, refine elixirs, craft artifacts, and fend off demonic invasions. You can even raid other players to plunder their resources! Whether you love farming, strategic management, casual idling, or intense combat, your destiny awaits.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4832390/extras/29a328d5388fa8e20b9d6326f25fce72.avif?t=1783079062\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4832390/extras_big/29a328d5388fa8e20b9d6326f25fce72.webp?t=1783079062 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ <strong>A Miniature World, Infinite Possibilities</strong><br>Experience the full depth of a cultivation world in one compact package:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Massive Content:</strong> Unlock dozens of Celestial Realms and recruit hundreds of unique disciples.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Riches:</strong> Discover diverse spiritual plants, rare ores, 100+ spirit beasts, hundreds of divine artifacts, and thousands of secret techniques.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>True Idle Progression:</strong> Your Sect continues to operate and accumulate resources even while you are offline.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4832390/extras/4d083ce83f55860aea5b501211e75bb0.avif?t=1783079062\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4832390/extras_big/4d083ce83f55860aea5b501211e75bb0.avif?t=1783079062 width=1560 height=268 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4832390/extras/ec7b23a78b6900e48d179626b4ff3498.avif?t=1783079062\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4832390/extras_big/ec7b23a78b6900e48d179626b4ff3498.avif?t=1783079062 width=1560 height=268 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4832390/extras/95ae4af32385731086e9929e3f1a2d07.avif?t=1783079062\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4832390/extras_big/95ae4af32385731086e9929e3f1a2d07.avif?t=1783079062 width=1560 height=268 /></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ <strong>Seamless Desktop Integration</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sumeru Mode:</strong> Shrink your entire sect into a subtle Tai Chi icon with a single click—perfect for multitasking.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersion Mode:</strong> Expand to full-screen whenever you want to lose yourself in the details of your sect’s growth, from peaceful farming to epic battles.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4832390/extras/c99d8205a55ebb18e39465f73b0a088b.avif?t=1783079062\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■<strong> Dynamic Social &amp; Entertainment</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><